      "fieldId": "1a000002-0000-4000-a000-000000000002",
      "value": "Adds three optional fields to SectionSource.type-query: lifecycleStates (multi-value inclusion filter), excludeLifecycleStates (exclusion filter), and containerScope (explicit | repository | subtree). Enables the decision-log pattern: rendering all non-superseded/non-abandoned decisions across a repository without listing every container ID. Tracked in the-greenman/srs#41.",
      "agent": {
        "type": "Ai"
      },
